   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Write off Loan to Nordisk Tr&#xe4;behandling AB (NT AB). Transfer of Swedish timber and wood know-how. Sale of Swedish wood-drying equipement and training of maintenance staff in Bosnia and Hercegovina. A StartBosnia 1997 project.</narrative>
